<title>USA: Sunair chairman gets offer to buy majority stake.</title>
<headline>Sunair chairman gets offer to buy majority stake.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sunair Electronics Inc Chairman Robert Uricho said Wednesday he received an unsolicited offer to purchase his roughly 50.7 percent of the company's outstanding stock at $4.25 per share.</p>
<p>Uricho said the offer has been tentatively accepted contingent upon approval of the board of directors and counsels of both parties.</p>
<p>Company spokesperson was immediately available for comment.</p>
</text>
